{
  "uid": "pacod-usage",
  "title": "pacod — Usage (sites, agents, LLM)",
  "tags": [
    "pacod",
    "usage",
    "llm"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "site",
        "label": "Site",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(llm_requests_total, site)",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(llm_requests_total, site)",
          "refId": "PrometheusVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "options": [],
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "profile",
        "label": "Profile",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(llm_requests_total, profile)",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(llm_requests_total, profile)",
          "refId": "PrometheusVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "options": [],
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Where the rest of the usage data lives",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Aggregate, label-level usage only.** Per-user usage, page views and dwell time live in the admin console **Analytics** page (Postgres), not in Prometheus.\n\n**Worker-side LLM usage is missing here.** The improvement loop, newsletter worker and price refresh run in processes Prometheus does not scrape, so their `site=\"internal\"` calls/tokens/cost appear only partly (whatever runs inside `api`/`admin-api`) — the admin Analytics page has the complete picture. `$site`/`$profile` filter every panel whose series carry those labels (`llm_retries_total` has neither)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Web",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Frontend requests (req/s) by site & user type",
      "description": "pacod_frontend_http_requests_total from the SvelteKit frontend (site label), bots excluded (see the Crawlers dashboard). Only the $site filter applies.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (site, user_type) (rate(pacod_frontend_http_requests_total{user_type!=\"bot\", site=~\"$site\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{site}} · {{user_type}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Agent requests (req/s) by site",
      "description": "Completed agent requests per site: chat turns (request_completed), from agent_events_total.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (site) (rate(agent_events_total{event_type=\"request_completed\", site=~\"$site\", profile=~\"$profile\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{site}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Agents",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Agent events (events/s) by site, profile & type",
      "description": "All audit events (request_completed, request_accepted, rejected_*, …) as counted by agent_events_total.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (site, profile, event_type) (rate(agent_events_total{site=~\"$site\", profile=~\"$profile\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{site}} · {{profile}} · {{event_type}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Chat turns (24h)",
      "description": "request_completed events over the last 24h.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "mappings": [],
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(increase(agent_events_total{event_type=\"request_completed\", site=~\"$site\", profile=~\"$profile\"}[24h])) or vector(0))",
          "legendFormat": "turns"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Rejected requests (24h)",
      "description": "rejected_* events (guards, quotas, topic guard) over the last 24h.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 22
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "mappings": [],
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(increase(agent_events_total{event_type=~\"rejected_.*\", site=~\"$site\", profile=~\"$profile\"}[24h])) or vector(0))",
          "legendFormat": "rejected"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "LLM calls (24h)",
      "description": "Logical LLM calls (after retries), any outcome, over the last 24h.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 22
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "mappings": [],
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(increase(llm_requests_total{site=~\"$site\", profile=~\"$profile\"}[24h])) or vector(0))",
          "legendFormat": "calls"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "LLM calls",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "LLM calls (calls/s) by site, profile & model",
      "description": "Logical LLM calls (one per call after retries), all outcomes.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (site, profile, model) (rate(llm_requests_total{site=~\"$site\", profile=~\"$profile\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{site}} · {{profile}} · {{model}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "LLM error ratio by model (15m)",
      "description": "Share of logical calls that ended in error or timeout (after retries).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 28
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (model) (rate(llm_requests_total{outcome!=\"ok\", site=~\"$site\", profile=~\"$profile\"}[15m])) / clamp_min(sum by (model) (rate(llm_requests_total{site=~\"$site\", profile=~\"$profile\"}[15m])), 1e-9)",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Failed LLM calls per 15m by outcome & model",
      "description": "Calls that ended in error or timeout. Timeouts are never retried (see LLM_TIMEOUT_SECONDS), so each one here is a user-visible failure.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 36
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (outcome, model) (increase(llm_requests_total{outcome!=\"ok\", site=~\"$site\", profile=~\"$profile\"}[15m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}} · {{model}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "LLM retries (retries/s) by model & purpose",
      "description": "Transient failures that were retried (llm_retries_total). This series has no site/profile labels, so the dashboard filters do not apply.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 36
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (model, purpose) (rate(llm_retries_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}} · {{purpose}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Tokens",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 44
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "LLM tokens and cost: the gateway's",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 45
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Tokens, cost, latency and provider errors of every LLM call are recorded by the gateway (pacod-gw): see the **pacod-gw** dashboard folder (Overview, Providers & models, Workspaces) and its console. The panels on this dashboard count what the app itself sees: requests, turns, guard rejections, and LLM call outcomes including client timeouts."
      },
      "id": 22
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Cost (estimated)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 53
      },
      "panels": []
    }
  ]
}
